{
  "name": "dsh-ofm-addition",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "OFM Addition — Our Free Model 的附属插件。两项能力：①回答因达到输出 token 上限被截断时自动替你发送「继续」（连续次数可设上限或「不限」，并在接近上下文窗口时自动停下）；②每个 Our Free Model 路由的请求参数表——思考档位、输出上限、温度与停止序列，可逐模型调整、一键顶配，或让一个模型按各模型声明的能力填写。",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "src",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "our-free-model",
    "addon",
    "model-parameters",
    "reasoning-effort"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/DeepseekDays/dsh-ofm-addition.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/DeepseekDays/dsh-ofm-addition#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/DeepseekDays/dsh-ofm-addition/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/model-params.test.mjs test/policy.test.mjs test/ledger.test.mjs test/host.test.mjs test/client.test.mjs test/transcript.test.mjs test/manifest.test.mjs"
  }
}
